# SERVER-SIDE secrets for the edge functions. This file is never bundled into a
# website and must never be committed with real values (`.env` is git-ignored).
#
# Load into a hosted project with:  supabase secrets set --env-file supabase/.env
#
# Not listed on purpose: SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY. Supabase
# injects both into every edge function itself, so the powerful key never has to
# be copied anywhere by hand.

# Where the public site lives, WITHOUT a trailing slash. The form function
# redirects here after a submission. While on GitHub Pages it includes the repo
# path, e.g. https://USER.github.io/REPO — on the final domain just the origin.
SITE_URL=
